OL,3,GNEWSAHuge 100th birthday party for
OL,4,Atown's beloved park
OL,5,
OL,6,FCelebrations are taking place to mark
OL,7,Fthe 100th birthday of Blackpool's
OL,8,FStanley Park.
OL,10,FThe park has been beloved by
OL,11,Fgenerations of Blackpudlians as well as
OL,12,Fcountless thousands of visitors to the
OL,13,FLancashire seaside resort.
OL,15,FBlackpool Council said the Grade
OL,16,FII-listed park was as one of the UK's
OL,17,Fmost significant green spaces and had
OL,18,Ftwice been voted the country's best
OL,19,Fpark.
OL,21,FStanley Park was officially opened on 2
OL,22,FOctober 1926 by the 17th Earl of Derby.
